          low: 5703780688726319795
          high: 1546492945430047116
        editorPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
        speakerName: Eldor
        text: Thank you. The well behind my manor... that is where he was last seen. May the gods watch over you.
        nextNodeId:
          low: 5371963411559620666
          high: -4909725883238091362
    - rid: 4304780615459536937
      type: {class: LineNode, ns: CRPG.Dialogue, asm: CRPG.Dialogue}
      data:
        nodeId:
          low: 5354566156531703641
          high: -4843673578859254354
        editorPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
        speakerName: Eldor
        text: Then pray they do not involve the safety of your own family.
        nextNodeId:
          low: 5371963411559620666
          high: -4909725883238091362
    - rid: 4304780615459536938
      type: {class: LineNode, ns: CRPG.Dialogue, asm: CRPG.Dialogue}
      data:
        nodeId:
          low: 4838274669066447542
          high: -396687096703783278
        editorPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
        speakerName: Eldor
        text: Please, hurry back with news of my son.
